cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "gitrialsim: Simulation-Guided Trial Design for Gastroenterology and Hepatology"
abstract: >-
  A parameterization and orchestration layer for planning gastroenterology and
  hepatology randomised trials. Clinical scenarios are described by versioned,
  fully cited parameter packs; designs are evaluated by delegating to validated
  engines (rpact and gsDesign) rather than reimplementing their statistics, and
  by Monte Carlo simulation for designs whose operating characteristics have no
  closed form. Results follow the ADEMP reporting framework with Monte Carlo
  standard errors.
type: software
